# Semgrep path exclusions for the bedrock module scan (see the repository root's
# .semgrepignore for the same entries under their root-relative paths).
#
# bedrock renders Terraform, YAML and Markdown from text/template: html/template's contextual
# escaping would corrupt that output, so the renderer is excluded from the text-template
# audit rather than marked inline. The GitHub test fake answers JSON to the client under
# test, so the direct-write audit (an HTML page writing user data) does not apply to it.
internal/render/render.go
internal/github/githubtest/server.go
